# Cloud Build's upload filter.
#
# Without this file gcloud derives one from .gitignore, which excludes data/index.json —
# and the Dockerfile would then rebuild the index from scratch inside every container
# build, turning a seconds-long build into roughly forty-five minutes of SEC calls.
#
# These are build artefacts that git should not carry but Cloud Build must receive, so
# each is listed as an explicit un-ignore. Miss one and the image builds fine, starts
# fine, and serves an empty result set for that dataset — a silent failure, which is why
# /health reports the row count of both.
!data/index.json
!data/form-d.json
!data/florida-net-worth.json
!data/form-144.json
!data/physician-ownership.json

.git/
.gitignore
node_modules/
data-smoke/
*.log
